# This repo's analytics MCP is read-only and does not need a NETWORK value.
# It reads public cross-chain USDD API data and does not sign transactions.
#
# For wallet state and write operations, use the official @usdd/mcp-server-usdd.
# Pass the target network in official MCP tool arguments:
#   mainnet: tron, eth, bsc
#   testnet: tron_nile, eth_sepolia, bsc_testnet
#
# RPC keys and optional node overrides belong to the official MCP env in the
# AI client configuration, not to this repo's .env file. Supported overrides:
#   TRONGRID_API_KEY, TRON_FULL_NODE, TRON_NILE_FULL_NODE
#   ETH_RPC_URL, ETH_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL
#   BSC_RPC_URL, BSC_TESTNET_RPC_URL
